      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HfO2 scale will reduce oxygen ingress into the refractory high-entropy alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6212920::web::051::4_3_1_tin_rich_areas",
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will lower oxidation-induced mass gain by at least 20% relative to an uncoated alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated starting material is an as-cast Mo-Nb-Ta-W-based refractory high-entropy alloy without protective surface treatment.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Hf-containing coating can be deposited by pack cementation or physical vapor deposition.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed operating condition is static air at 1200 °C for 100 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf in the coating acts as an oxygen-scavenging element by reacting with oxygen at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6804173::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reaction of Hf with oxygen forms a stable HfO2 layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf reduces oxygen penetration or oxygen diffusivity at elevated temperature.",
